/value "false"] [:db/ensure "bd48ae13-0ac2-55cd-85b8-8715b9df1712" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2c3b4623-c248-5a02-b8ee-7ba16209f579" :answer/id #uuid "2c3b4623-c248-5a02-b8ee-7ba16209f579"] [:db/add "2c3b4623-c248-5a02-b8ee-7ba16209f579" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "2c3b4623-c248-5a02-b8ee-7ba16209f579" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "2c3b4623-c248-5a02-b8ee-7ba16209f579" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b207d561-698d-59e0-a012-bb9ff356ca43" :answer-field/id #uuid "b207d561-698d-59e0-a012-bb9ff356ca43"] [:db/add "b207d561-698d-59e0-a012-bb9ff356ca43" :answer-field/key "$det(A)=0$"] [:db/add "b207d561-698d-59e0-a012-bb9ff356ca43" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "b207d561-698d-59e0-a012-bb9ff356ca43" :answer-field/choices "bd48ae13-0ac2-55cd-85b8-8715b9df1712"] [:db/add "b207d561-698d-59e0-a012-bb9ff356ca43" :answer-field/choices "2c3b4623-c248-5a02-b8ee-7ba16209f579"] [:db/add "b207d561-698d-59e0-a012-bb9ff356ca43" :answer-field/correct "2c3b4623-c248-5a02-b8ee-7ba16209f579"] [:db/ensure "b207d561-698d-59e0-a012-bb9ff356ca43" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5b807f80-d3e7-5284-9d78-b367cb5db361" :question/id #uuid "5b807f80-d3e7-5284-9d78-b367cb5db361"] [:db/add "5b807f80-d3e7-5284-9d78-b367cb5db361" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true, given that $A$ is a $3\\times 3$ matrix and  $\\text{Null}(A)=\\left\\{\\begin{bmatrix}2a \\\\ 3a \\\\ 3b\\end{bmatrix}\\,|\\,a,b\\in R\\right\\}?$\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/add "5b807f80-d3e7-5284-9d78-b367cb5db361" :question/worked-solution "Since $A$ is a $3\\times 3$ matrix, the invertible matrix theorem states the following:\n\n$A$ is invertible\n\n$$\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Col}(A) &=\\mathbb{R}^{3} \\\\ \\dim(\\operatorname{Col}(A)) &=3=\\operatorname{rank}(A) \\\\ \\operatorname{Null}(A) &=\\{0\\} \\\\ \\dim(\\operatorname{Null}(A)) &=0=\\operatorname{nullity}(A)\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$  \n\nAlso, according to the rank-nullity theorem, if $A$ is a matrix with $n$ columns, then \n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)+\\text{nullity}(A)=n.\n$$\n\nThe supplied null space has the independent spanning vectors\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\;\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThus $\\text{nullity}(A)=2.$\n\nBy the rank-nullity theorem,\n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)+\\text{nullity}(A)=n.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)+2=3,\\qquad \\text{rank}(A)=3-2=1.\n$$\n\nHence $\\text{rank}(A)=1$ and $\\text{nullity}(A)=2$. Since rank is less than the number of columns, $A$ is not invertible and $\\det(A)=0$. Also, $\\text{Col}(A)$ has dimension 1. The number of pivot columns is 1, and the number of non-pivot columns is 2.\n\n- Statement “$A$ is not invertible” is true. The rank is less than the number of columns.\n\n- Statement “$\\text{rank}(A)=0$” is false. $\\text{rank}(A)=1$.\n\n- Statement “$det(A)=0$” is true. $A$ is not invertible, so $\\det(A)=0$.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $A$ is not invertible; $det(A)=0$."] [:db/add "5b807f80-d3e7-5284-9d78-b367cb5db361" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "5b807f80-d3e7-5284-9d78-b367cb5db361" :question/answer-fields "54107d25-70b8-589c-83d0-fde2f4e5a0fb"] [:db/add "5b807f80-d3e7-5284-9d78-b367cb5db361" :question/answer-fields "a989528a-e5a8-5859-bd54-1f3759ea645b"] [:db/add "5b807f80-d3e7-5284-9d78-b367cb5db361" :question/answer-fields "b207d561-698d-59e0-a012-bb9ff356ca43"] [:db/ensure "5b807f80-d3e7-5284-9d78-b367cb5db361" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184172 :knowledge-point/questions "5b807f80-d3e7-5284-9d78-b367cb5db361"] [:db/add "50595a0f-e68c-5eb9-8d4e-509557233567" :answer/id #uuid "50595a0f-e68c-5eb9-8d4e-509557233567"] [:db/add "50595a0f-e68c-5eb9-8d4e-509557233567" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "50595a0f-e68c-5eb9-8d4e-509557233567" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "50595a0f-e68c-5eb9-8d4e-509557233567" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4bf661d7-522d-523e-924c-cf70e56ef4c7