-ee4d9e72432e" :answer-field/choices "7cdb4946-a773-51de-8878-8b57d29bd2a9"] [:db/add "7e9d96e5-a8d2-524c-9ca1-ee4d9e72432e" :answer-field/choices "8e4ad4a5-953b-533a-8148-f2399789ddb6"] [:db/add "7e9d96e5-a8d2-524c-9ca1-ee4d9e72432e" :answer-field/correct "7cdb4946-a773-51de-8878-8b57d29bd2a9"] [:db/ensure "7e9d96e5-a8d2-524c-9ca1-ee4d9e72432e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "bb6ddb6a-a2fb-5bdc-afea-25f9024d2e18" :answer/id #uuid "bb6ddb6a-a2fb-5bdc-afea-25f9024d2e18"] [:db/add "bb6ddb6a-a2fb-5bdc-afea-25f9024d2e18" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "bb6ddb6a-a2fb-5bdc-afea-25f9024d2e18" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "bb6ddb6a-a2fb-5bdc-afea-25f9024d2e18" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cba8c704-e212-5518-be74-5971633bb01d" :answer/id #uuid "cba8c704-e212-5518-be74-5971633bb01d"] [:db/add "cba8c704-e212-5518-be74-5971633bb01d" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "cba8c704-e212-5518-be74-5971633bb01d" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "cba8c704-e212-5518-be74-5971633bb01d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b5ec3bf1-9be3-5daa-bfbb-855721c618f1" :answer-field/id #uuid "b5ec3bf1-9be3-5daa-bfbb-855721c618f1"] [:db/add "b5ec3bf1-9be3-5daa-bfbb-855721c618f1" :answer-field/key "$\\text{nullity}(A)=2$"] [:db/add "b5ec3bf1-9be3-5daa-bfbb-855721c618f1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "b5ec3bf1-9be3-5daa-bfbb-855721c618f1" :answer-field/choices "bb6ddb6a-a2fb-5bdc-afea-25f9024d2e18"] [:db/add "b5ec3bf1-9be3-5daa-bfbb-855721c618f1" :answer-field/choices "cba8c704-e212-5518-be74-5971633bb01d"] [:db/add "b5ec3bf1-9be3-5daa-bfbb-855721c618f1" :answer-field/correct "bb6ddb6a-a2fb-5bdc-afea-25f9024d2e18"] [:db/ensure "b5ec3bf1-9be3-5daa-bfbb-855721c618f1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f7fdbf75-0d39-5481-92c5-3bb3459c2aeb" :question/id #uuid "f7fdbf75-0d39-5481-92c5-3bb3459c2aeb"] [:db/add "f7fdbf75-0d39-5481-92c5-3bb3459c2aeb" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true given that $A$ is a $7\\times 7$ matrix which has only $2$ non-pivot column?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/add "f7fdbf75-0d39-5481-92c5-3bb3459c2aeb" :question/worked-solution "Since $A$ is a $7\\times 7$ matrix, the invertible matrix theorem states the following:\n\n$A$ is invertible\n\n$$\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Col}(A) &=\\mathbb{R}^{7} \\\\ \\dim(\\operatorname{Col}(A)) &=7=\\operatorname{rank}(A) \\\\ \\operatorname{Null}(A) &=\\{0\\} \\\\ \\dim(\\operatorname{Null}(A)) &=0=\\operatorname{nullity}(A)\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAlso, according to the rank-nullity theorem, if $A$ is a matrix with $n$ columns, then \n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)+\\text{nullity}(A)=n.\n$$\n\nThe 2 non-pivot columns give $\\text{nullity}(A)=2.$\n\nBy the rank-nullity theorem,\n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)+\\text{nullity}(A)=n.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)+2=7,\\qquad \\text{rank}(A)=7-2=5.\n$$\n\nHence $\\text{rank}(A)=5$ and $\\text{nullity}(A)=2$. Since rank is less than the number of columns, $A$ is not invertible and $\\det(A)=0$. Also, $\\text{Col}(A)$ has dimension 5. The number of pivot columns is 5, and the number of non-pivot columns is 2.\n\n- Statement “$A$ is not invertible” is true. The rank is less than the number of columns.\n\n- Statement “$\\text{Col}(A)$ is a $3$-dimensional subspace of ${R}^{7}.$” is false. $\\dim(\\text{Col}(A))=5$.\n\n- Statement “$\\text{nullity}(A)=2$” is true. $\\text{nullity}(A)=2$.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $A$ is not invertible; $\\text{nullity}(A)=2$."] [:db/add "f7fdbf75-0d39-5481-92c5-3bb3459c2aeb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f7fdbf75-0d39-5481-92c5-3bb3459c2aeb" :question/answer-fields "56e65182-7ecd-5970-9716-4a82b7f451d7"] [:db/add "f7fdbf75-0d39-5481-92c5-3bb3459c2aeb" :question/answer-fields "7e9d96e5-a8d2-524c-9ca1-ee4d9e72432e"] [:db/add "f7fdbf75-0d39-5481-92c5-3bb3459c2aeb" :question/answer-fields "b5ec3bf1-9be3-5daa-bfbb-855721c618f1"] [:db/ensure "f7fdbf75-0d39-5481-92c5-3bb3459c2aeb" :question/validate] [:d